=== DIAGNOSIS ===
The drift gate did its job and caught a real defect that landed in
phase-42 prompt 0014 (commit aa46d37f8). The committed file
internal/tesla/protomodel/datum_decoder_gen.go does NOT match what the
generator in cmd/protogen-tesla/emit.go currently emits.

Differences observed between committed file and regenerated output:

  - Committed: declares ar ErrInvalid and ar ErrUnsetValue.
    Generator:  declares only ar ErrInvalidDatum (different name,
                no unset-oneof sentinel).

  - Committed: imports ftproto + uses typed compound structs
                (Doors, Time, TireLocation) defined in compounds.go.
    Generator:  redefines Doors, Time, TireLocation INLINE in
                datum_decoder_gen.go, which collides with compounds.go.

If the regenerated file is accepted as-is, the package no longer
compiles:

  go build ./internal/tesla/protomodel/... output:
    datum_decoder_gen.go:15:6: Doors redeclared in this block
        compounds.go:36:6: other declaration of Doors
    datum_decoder_gen.go:35:6: Time redeclared in this block
        compounds.go:71:6: other declaration of Time
    datum_decoder_gen.go:44:6: TireLocation redeclared in this block
        compounds.go:53:6: other declaration of TireLocation

Tests in datum_decoder_test.go also reference the committed shape:
  ErrInvalid, ErrUnsetValue, Doors{...} (from compounds.go).

Conclusion: prompt 0014 committed a hand-edited / out-of-sync version
of datum_decoder_gen.go relative to the emitter. This prompt's drift
gate is correctly flagging it. The fix is OUT OF SCOPE for prompt 0015
(allowed files do not include cmd/protogen-tesla/emit.go or the
generated file). Resolution requires either:

  (a) reopen prompt 0014: update cmd/protogen-tesla/emit.go so
      renderDatumDecoder emits the ErrInvalid + ErrUnsetValue +
      compounds.go-aware shape that the test suite expects; OR
  (b) a new corrective phase-42 prompt that re-aligns the generator
      and the generated file under a single commit.

Until the upstream defect is resolved, prompt 0015 cannot land green.
Per Honesty Covenant rules 1, 8 and 9, this run is recorded as BLOCKED
and only the log is committed; the new files generate.go, the Makefile
edits, and proto-gen-check.yml are left uncommitted in the working
tree so the next attempt can pick them up unchanged once the upstream
